{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109459","id":3306290021,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7FEftl","number":109459,"title":"Per instance shader settings revert to defaults in exported game, when applied to a CSG node","user":{"login":"FilipLundby","id":9482792,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0ODI3OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9482792?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby","html_url":"https://github.com/FilipLundby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FilipLundby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-08-09T12:13:35Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T14:50:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.1-stable\n\n### System information\n\nFedora 42 - Vulkan, Forward+\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn an exported game per instance parameter settings on custom shader are reverted to default values, if applied to a CSG node. \n\nChosen color in editor:\n\n<img width=\"335\" height=\"83\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c2d66376-8e40-476a-a058-3febb750751f\" />\n\nIn editor - CSG left, MeshInstance3D right:\n\n<img width=\"1165\" height=\"693\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/218036ea-4307-4499-849e-e0114d7995ea\" />\n\nExported game - CSG left, MeshInstance3D right:\n\n<img width=\"1151\" height=\"646\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af678587-2937-4a5b-8dd1-a7010ad69448\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n\n1. Add a CSG node\n2. Add a shader with per instance settings: \n    ```\n    shader_type spatial;\n    \n    instance uniform vec4 albedo: source_color;\n    \n    void fragment() {\n        ALBEDO = albedo.rgb;\n    }\n3. Choose a color in the Instance Shader Parameters in the Inspector\n4. Export and play the game\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[demo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21697957/demo.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109459/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}